](/wiki/Total_primary_energy_supply "Total primary energy supply") (TPES), a
term used to indicate the sum of production and imports subtracting exports
and storage changes (see also [ Worldwide energy supply
](/wiki/Worldwide_energy_supply "Worldwide energy supply") ). Numbers are from
The [ World Bank ](/wiki/World_Bank "World Bank") \- World Development
Indicators.  [1]

